WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:10.502
Aww. You're cute!

2
00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:13.188
Who are you?

3
00:00:13.738 --> 00:00:15.603
I'm a meerkat.

4
00:00:15.821 --> 00:00:18.413
Meerkats are mongooses.

5
00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:22.111
Where do you live?

6
00:00:22.781 --> 00:00:24.803
We live in Africa.

7
00:00:25.414 --> 00:00:29.568
We like grasslands and deserts.

8
00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:33.586
Do you dig burrows?

9
00:00:33.998 --> 00:00:37.490
Yes. We stay cool and safe underground.

10
00:00:38.559 --> 00:00:41.355
We live in groups called mobs.

11
00:00:43.341 --> 00:00:46.184
Does your mob work together?

12
00:00:46.518 --> 00:00:49.229
Yes. We take turns with jobs.

13
00:00:49.907 --> 00:00:52.931
Some meerkats protect all the babies.

14
00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.018
Others watch for enemies.

15
00:00:57.487 --> 00:00:59.548
Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:03.459
Jackals, birds, and snakes eat us.

17
00:01:04.278 --> 00:01:06.742
But we can hide in our burrows.

18
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:12.055
Or our mob stands together and scares them!

19
00:01:14.499 --> 00:01:16.787
Do you make any sounds?

20
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.775
Meerkats chatter to one another.

21
00:01:20.197 --> 00:01:23.023
We also hiss loudly at enemies.

22
00:01:24.404 --> 00:01:27.732
And we warn each other with alarm calls.

23
00:01:28.512 --> 00:01:30.727
What do meerkats eat?

24
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:34.797
We eat things like scorpions, spiders, and bugs.

25
00:01:35.502 --> 00:01:37.945
We have a good sense of smell.

26
00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.003
That helps us find food.

27
00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.235
Uh-oh. Here comes a jackal.

28
00:01:47.644 --> 00:01:49.737
I'm going to warn my mob!

29
00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.997
Bye, Meerkat!

